Patches origin
--------------

For out-of-tree device support, patches were imported from the following
community-maintained kernel forks:
  * sdm845: https://gitlab.com/sdm845-mainline/linux

Those patchsets were last synced on the following dates:
  * sdm845: 2026-01-06

Patch debian/patches/sdm845/0235-HACK-drm-panel-s6e3fc2x01-skip-reset-and-keep-always.patch
was imported from branch sdm845/6.16-dev of sdm845-mainline repository.
Maintainer of sdm845-mainline was informed about this patch being required, otherwise fajita's
panel cannot be powered up after been reset, e.g. pressing repeatedly the power button.
As soon as the patch is included in the 6.18 branch of sdm845-mainline, these last lines
can be dropped.
